@baseUrl      = http://localhost:3000
@companyToken = PASTE_TOKEN_COMPANY_DISINI

# Role "company" = pemilik/HR perusahaan
# Setelah register & login, buat perusahaan terlebih dahulu


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  DASHBOARD
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Dashboard Company
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  PROFIL PERUSAHAAN
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Buat Perusahaan (JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PT Maju Bersama",
  "email": "info@ptmaju.com",
  "phone": "021-5551234",
  "description": "Perusahaan teknologi terkemuka di Indonesia yang bergerak di bidang pengembangan software",
  "website": "https://ptmaju.com",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "industry": "Teknologi Informasi",
  "company_size": "51-200"
}

### Buat Perusahaan + Logo (multipart/form-data)
### Field: logo  |  Tipe: file  |  Format: JPG/PNG/WEBP  |  Max: 2MB
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FormBoundary

------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

PT Maju Bersama
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

info@ptmaju.com
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone"

021-5551234
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Perusahaan teknologi terkemuka di Indonesia
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

Jakarta
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="industry"

Teknologi Informasi
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_size"

51-200
------FormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="logo"; filename="logo_ptmaju.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./logo_ptmaju.png
------FormBoundary--

### Lihat Perusahaan Saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Update Perusahaan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PT Maju Bersama Indonesia",
  "phone": "021-5559999",
  "description": "Perusahaan teknologi & konsultan IT terkemuka",
  "website": "https://ptmajuindonesia.com",
  "location": "Jakarta Selatan",
  "industry": "Teknologi Informasi",
  "company_size": "201-500"
}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  LOWONGAN KERJA
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Kategori (publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### Buat Lowongan Full-time
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "title": "Backend Developer",
  "description": "Membangun dan memelihara API REST skala enterprise menggunakan Node.js dan MySQL",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "job_type": "full-time",
  "education_required": "S1",
  "experience_min_years": 2,
  "salary_min": 8000000,
  "salary_max": 15000000,
  "required_skills": ["nodejs", "mysql", "express", "rest-api", "git"],
  "deadline": "2026-08-31",
  "status": "open"
}

### Buat Lowongan Part-time
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 4,
  "title": "Graphic Designer",
  "description": "Membuat konten visual untuk kebutuhan marketing",
  "location": "Remote",
  "job_type": "part-time",
  "education_required": "D3",
  "experience_min_years": 1,
  "salary_min": 3000000,
  "salary_max": 6000000,
  "required_skills": ["photoshop", "illustrator", "figma"],
  "deadline": "2026-07-15"
}

### Buat Lowongan Magang
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "title": "UI/UX Design Intern",
  "description": "Program magang 3 bulan bagi mahasiswa aktif atau fresh graduate",
  "location": "Jakarta",
  "job_type": "internship",
  "education_required": "SMA/SMK",
  "experience_min_years": 0,
  "required_skills": ["figma", "canva"],
  "deadline": "2026-07-01"
}

### Lihat Semua Lowongan (publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Update Lowongan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Senior Backend Developer",
  "experience_min_years": 3,
  "salary_min": 12000000,
  "salary_max": 22000000,
  "required_skills": ["nodejs", "mysql", "express", "redis", "docker", "kubernetes"],
  "status": "open"
}

### Tutup Lowongan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "closed"
}

### Hapus Lowongan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  KELOLA LAMARAN
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Lihat Semua Lamaran (di semua job perusahaan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Lihat Pelamar per Job (lengkap + profil)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/job/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Detail Lamaran + Profil Pelamar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Ubah Status → Reviewed
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Reviewed"
}

### Ubah Status → Interview
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Interview"
}

### Ubah Status → Accepted
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Accepted"
}

### Ubah Status → Rejected
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/applications/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Rejected"
}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  SHORTLIST KANDIDAT
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Tambah ke Shortlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/shortlists
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application_id": 1,
  "notes": "Kandidat sangat potensial, lanjutkan ke interview"
}

### Lihat Shortlist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shortlists
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Hapus dari Shortlist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/shortlists/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  JADWAL INTERVIEW
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Jadwalkan Interview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "2026-07-20 09:00:00",
  "meetingLink": "https://meet.google.com/xyz-abcd-efg",
  "location": "Kantor PT Maju Bersama, Lantai 5",
  "notes": "Interview HR + teknis, bawa dokumen pendukung"
}

### Lihat Interview per Lamaran
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/applications/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Lihat Semua Interview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}

### Update Interview
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scheduledAt": "2026-07-21 10:00:00",
  "notes": "Reschedule karena konflik jadwal"
}

### Hapus Interview
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/interviews/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}


### ══════════════════════════════════════════
###  MATCHING KANDIDAT
### ══════════════════════════════════════════

### Match Kandidat untuk Job
### Skor: Skills 50pt + Pendidikan 20pt + Pengalaman 20pt + Lokasi 10pt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/matching/job/1
Authorization: Bearer {{companyToken}}
